Server init.
>> a := Blob vaovao: 4.
a bytes: ( Lisitra vaovao ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob vaovao: 4.
b bytes: ( Lisitra vaovao ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a vaovao.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Vokatra soraty: ( a ^ c ), andalana-vaovao. } sambory: { :e Vokatra soraty: e, andalana-vaovao. }, atombohy.
a afaho.
b afaho.
